{
  "ordre-mission": [
    {
      "text": "Ordre de mission — Rang D",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Village Caché de la Feuille — Bureau des missions",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Client : la cheffe Oume, village de Kawabe",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "(au bord du lac Kagami, à un jour et demi à l'est).",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Demande :",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "« Un fantôme hante notre lac chaque nuit. Il fait",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "fuir nos familles. Envoyez-nous des ninjas pour",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "le chasser et rassurer le village. »",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Équipe : Inaba Shûhei (chûnin, chef)",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Akimichi Bunta · Hibana Kaito · Nara Shizuka",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fûma Tsumugi · Sakuraba Momo",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Paiement : 15 000 ryôs.",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Départ immédiat. Bonne chance !",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "italic"
    },
    {
      "text": "火",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
  "legende-kagami": [
    {
      "text": "La légende du seigneur Kagami",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Il y a deux cents ans, quand la guerre approchait,",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "le bon seigneur Kagami rassembla l'or du village",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "et le cacha sur l'île au milieu du lac.",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sur son sanctuaire, il posa une lanterne de pierre",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "et demanda aux lucioles de veiller sur l'île.",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "« Tant que la lanterne brillera, les lucioles",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "danseront. Et quand Kawabe sera dans le malheur,",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "l'or qui dort sous la lanterne l'aidera. »",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Depuis bien des années, plus personne n'allume",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "italic"
    },
    {
      "text": "la lanterne… et les lucioles ont disparu.",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "italic"
    },
    {
      "text": "鏡",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
  "registre-kaneda": [
    {
      "text": "Registre de Kaneda — dépenses",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mois du Héron",
      "weight": "bold",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "3e jour — Pelles (6), cordes (4) .......... 1 200 ryôs",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "5e jour — U., 1er versement (brouillard) ... 20 000 ryôs",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "9e jour — Terres de la famille Hoshi ...... 8 000 ryôs",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "11e jour — U., 2e versement (brouillard) .. 20 000 ryôs",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "12e jour — Terres des familles Mori, Ida .. 15 000 ryôs",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "14e jour — Brigands de G. (la Gorge) ...... 1 500 ryôs",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "15e jour — Terres des familles Sato, Ueno 12 000 ryôs",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dans la marge, d'une écriture pressée :",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "italic"
    },
    {
      "text": "« U. dit qu'il faut encore trois nuits.",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le coffre est sous la lanterne. Ne rien dire",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "text": "à Mosuke. » — et un dessin de l'île.",
      "weight": "normal",
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ]
}